t","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/imprint#haftung-für-links","content":"Unser Angebot enthält Links zu externen Websites Dritter, auf deren Inhalte wir\nkeinen Einfluss haben. Deshalb können wir für diese fremden Inhalte auch keine\nGewähr übernehmen. Für die Inhalte der verlinkten Seiten ist stets der jeweilige\nAnbieter oder Betreiber der Seiten verantwortlich."},"1758":{"id":"/docs/imprint-19","page_id":"/docs/imprint","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/imprint#urheberrecht","content":"Die durch die Seitenbetreiber erstellten Inhalte und Werke auf diesen Seiten\nunterliegen dem deutschen Urheberrecht. Die Vervielfältigung, Bearbeitung,\nVerbreitung und jede Art der Verwertung außerhalb der Grenzen des Urheberrechtes\nbedürfen der schriftlichen Zustimmung des jeweiligen Autors bzw. Erstellers."},"1759":{"id":"/docs","page_id":"/docs","type":"page","content":"Introduction","breadcrumbs":["Library","Getting started"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs"},"1760":{"id":"/docs-0","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"Native UI components for AI-agent products, in three frameworks."},"1761":{"id":"/docs-1","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#three-frameworks-one-design","content":"Three frameworks, one design"},"1762":{"id":"/docs-2","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#theming","content":"Theming"},"1763":{"id":"/docs-3","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#sections","content":"Sections"},"1764":{"id":"/docs-4","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#get-started","content":"Get started"},"1765":{"id":"/docs-5","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"**Visuno** is an open-source UI component library for building agent interfaces. Every component\nships natively for **React**, **Angular**, and **Flutter**, built from a single shared set of\ndesign tokens — so a component looks and behaves the same wherever you use it."},"1766":{"id":"/docs-6","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"Each component in these docs has a **live preview** you can toggle between light/dark and the two\nstyles, plus the code for all three frameworks side by side."},"1767":{"id":"/docs-7","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#three-frameworks-one-design","content":"| Framework | Form                          | Package         |\n| --------- | ----------------------------- | --------------- |\n| **React** | `.tsx` components (React 18+) | `@visuno/react` |","table":"table-0"},"1768":{"id":"/docs-8","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#three-frameworks-one-design","content":"| Framework   | Form                                                  | Package           |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------------------------------- | ----------------- |\n| **Angular** | Standalone components (`vo-*` selectors, Angular 18+) | `@visuno/angular` |","table":"table-0"},"1769":{"id":"/docs-9","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#three-frameworks-one-design","content":"| Framework   | Form                                  | Package             |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| **Flutter** | Dart widgets, themed to match the web | `visuno` on pub.dev |","table":"table-0"},"1770":{"id":"/docs-10","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#three-frameworks-one-design","content":"The React version is the reference; Angular and Flutter are native ports that mirror the same props\nand behavior."},"1771":{"id":"/docs-11","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#theming","content":"Every component responds to the same two switches, so your whole UI changes at once:"},"1772":{"id":"/docs-12","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#theming","content":"**Dark mode** — `data-theme=\"dark\"` on a parent element (web); `Brightness.dark` in the Flutter\ntheme."},"1773":{"id":"/docs-13","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#theming","content":"**Style** — the default **Blueprint** style, or **Soft** via `data-style=\"soft\"` (web). Blueprint\nis crisp and squared; Soft is rounded and plush."},"1774":{"id":"/docs-14","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#theming","content":"Design tokens (`--vo-*` on the web, `VoColors`/`VoSpace`/`VoRadius` in Flutter) drive every color,\nspace, radius, and motion — change a token once and it flows everywhere."},"1775":{"id":"/docs-15","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#sections","content":"Components are grouped by what they do in an agent product:"},"1776":{"id":"/docs-16","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#sections","content":"**Agent status** — show what the agent is doing: live status, thinking states, reasoning trails,\naction logs, run timelines, cost and context meters."},"1777":{"id":"/docs-17","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#sections","content":"**Charts and tables** — present data: stat cards and more."},"1778":{"id":"/docs-18","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#sections","content":"**Dates** — pick and switch: segmented controls and date tools."},"1779":{"id":"/docs-19","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#sections","content":"**Forms and inputs** — the basics: buttons, badges, progress, tooltips."},"1780":{"id":"/docs-20","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#get-started","content":"<Card title=\"Browse components\" href=\"/docs/components/status-pill\" description=\"Live previews and code for every component.\" />"},"1781":{"id":"/docs-21","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#get-started","content":"<Card title=\"Components on GitHub\" href=\"https://github.com/Visuno/components\" description=\"The source for all three frameworks.\" />"},"1782":{"id":"/docs-22","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#get-started","content":"Pick a component from the sidebar, copy the snippet for your framework, and drop it in. Pull the\nshared core once (tokens + helpers), and every component you add just works."},"1783":{"id":"/docs/roadmap","page_id":"/docs/roadmap","type":"page","content":"Roadmap","breadcrumbs":["Library"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/roadmap"},"1784":{"id":"/docs/roadmap-0","page_id":"/docs/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/roadmap","content":"Where Visuno is headed — what's shipped, in progress, and planned."},"1785":{"id":"/docs/roadmap-1","page_id":"/docs/roadmap","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/roadmap#shipped","content":"Shipped"},"1786":{"id":"/docs/roadmap-2","page_id":"/docs/roadmap","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/roadmap#in-progress","content":"In progress"},"1787":{"id":"/docs/roadmap-3","page_id":"/docs/roadmap","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/roadmap#planned","content":"Planned"},"1788":{"id":"/docs/roadmap-4","page_id":"/docs/roadmap","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/roadmap#exploring","content":"Exploring"},"1789":{"id":"/docs/roadmap-5","page_id":"/docs/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/roadmap","content":"Where Visuno is headed. This is a direction, not a dated commitment — priorities shift\nwith what people need. Have a request? Open an issue on\nGitHub."},"1790":{"id":"/docs/roadmap-6","page_id":"/docs/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/roadmap#shipped","content":"**Agent status** components — status pill, thinking, thinking states, reasoning trail,\nagent phases, step loader, action log, context meter, and more."},"1791":{"id":"/docs/roadmap-7","page_id":"/docs/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/roadmap#shipped","content":"**Conversation** components — live answer, thread panel, composer, model picker, voice\ncapture and orb, tool call, artifact card, and more."},"1792":{"id":"/docs/roadmap-8","page_id":"/docs/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/roadmap#shipped","content":"**Charts and tables**, **Dates**, and **Forms and inputs** — stat cards, segmented\ncontrol, buttons, badge, progress, and tooltip."},"1793":{"id":"/docs/roadmap-9","page_id":"/docs/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/roadmap#shipped","content":"**Docs site** with live previews, light/dark and Blueprint/Soft toggles, and per-framework\ncode for every component."},"1794":{"id":"/docs/roadmap-10","page_id":"/docs/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/roadmap#in-progress","content":"**Full three-framework parity** — bringing every documented component to React, Angular,\nand Flutter."},"1795":{"id":"/docs/roadmap-11","page_id":"/docs/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/roadmap#in-progress","content":"**Accessibility pass** — keyboard, focus, and reduced-motion coverage audited and\ndocumented per component."},"1796":{"id":"/docs/roadmap-12","page_id":"/docs/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/roadmap#in-progress","content":"**Theming guide** — a dedicated page on the `--vo-*` token system and how to build a\ncustom theme."},"1797":{"id":"/docs/roadmap-13","page_id":"/docs/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/roadmap#planned","content":"**Installation & setup guide** — a first-class getting-started flow per framework."},"1798":{"id":"/docs/roadmap-14","page_id":"/docs/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/roadmap#planned","content":"**Copy-paste recipes** — common agent-UI compositions built from several components."},"1799":{"id":"/docs/roadmap-15","page_id":"/docs/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/roadmap#planned","content":"**Versioned releases** — semver-tagged packages with migration notes in the\nchangelog."},"1800":{"id":"/docs/roadmap-16","page_id":"/docs/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/roadmap#planned","content":"**More components** — driven by what agent products actually need; suggestions welcome."},"1801":{"id":"/docs/roadmap-17","page_id":"/docs/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"te